child forces   child/FORCE_SETS, supercell 2 2 2
parent         parent/221_PPOSCAR_AlF3: Pm-3m (No. 221), 4 atoms, cell used as given
parent forces  parent/FORCE_SETS, supercell 2 2 2
setting        crystod-group --supergroup-cif parent/221_PPOSCAR_AlF3
               --subgroup-cif child/167_PPOSCAR_AlF3 (1 of 24 equivalent settings)
transformation parent -> child as crystod-group prints it (columns of P: the child basis in
